#!/usr/bin/env ssc
---
name: query-decode
version: 0.1.0
description: What a route handler receives in req.query for a percent-encoded value.
---
# query-decode

```scalascript
[route, serve, Request](std/http.ssc)

def handler(req: Request): String =
  "m=[" + req.query.get("m").getOrElse("<absent>") + "] q=[" + req.query.get("q").getOrElse("<absent>") + "]"

def main(): Unit =
  route("GET", "/q", req => handler(req))
  serve(8479)
```
